  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Convention on Cluster Munitions Implementation Support Unit (CCM-ISU). Support to the Cluster Convention&apos;s Implementation Support Unit contributes to achieving the goals in a priority area for Sweden, reducing the threat from mines, cluster munitions and other explosive remnants.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Verksamhetsst&#xf6;d till klusterkonventionens enhet f&#xf6;r implementeringsst&#xf6;d (CCM-ISU) 2023. St&#xf6;d till klusterkonventionens enhet f&#xf6;r implementeringsst&#xf6;d bidrar till att uppn&#xe5; m&#xe5;len inom ett f&#xf6;r Sverige prioriterat omr&#xe5;de, att minska hotet fr&#xe5;n minor, klusterammunition och andra explosiva l&#xe4;mningar.</narrative>
